    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Teachers want to know how they can better serve their culturally and linguistically diverse students. Diverso supports teachers in this pursuit by leveraging the power of just-in time instruction. A teacher’s real need provides the vehicle upon which culturally relevant theory and strategies are delivered at the moment they are most needed. In a friendly, chat-driven interface, teachers describe their everyday challenges and receive powerful theory and practices in return. Along the way, they build a critical understanding of how culture shapes learning and teaching.",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "McCabe, A. and Macedo, L. (2018). Diverso: Make learning relevant for all students. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at: https://purl.stanford.edu/vf888zz5383",
